From 30a186a0689a97cb26430b55648faf8ebd7bc474 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: homar <homar@local>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 09:38:29 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] homalawn no lawnchair name: no Lawnchair announcements, Homa
 Lawn's About, Homa Lawn in what a person reads

The banner at the top of the settings ("a first look at Lawnchair 16",
from lawnchair.app's live information) no longer shows: Homa Lawn's
default for show_announcements is false (homalawn/res, in the variant's
source set so it wins over lawnchair/res; the switch has no screen).
Live information stays on for its remote defaults.

Settings > About is Homa Lawn's (omalawn/HomaLawnAbout, one hook in the
navigation): the app's own icon, name and version, then "Built on
Lawnchair" with a row to lawnchair.app and the open-source licences.
Lawnchair's link row, team list, nightly updater and privacy policy go.

The Lawnchair name also goes from: five strings that name Lawnchair only
in some translations (added to BRAND_KEYS), the suggested backup file
name (HomaLawn_Backup, the .lawnchairbackup format unchanged), and our
own phone messages relayed to the desktop (Nova import errors, screen
control off).
